  "description": "<p>This bug can be seen by performing the following steps:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Start Fedora (either deploying the war into Tomcat or using the one-click)\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Note: Using \"mvn jetty:run\" does not show the error because it gets restarted by the build in the next step</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Build Fedora, noting that it hangs in the fcrepo-webapp project prior to the integration tests when Maven is starting up Jetty.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>The issue is not seen prior to the following ticket/commit:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3331\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3331</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/914045de578217a71ed55a63cab9b46fc6e916a2\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/914045de578217a71ed55a63cab9b46fc6e916a2</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
